<div style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a1f27; max-width: 560px">
  <p>Hi,</p>
  <p><strong><%= @inviter&.label || "A family organizer" %></strong> invited you to <strong><%= @family.name %></strong> on Parallex Family, a private place for the family to plan a reunion together: the family tree, voting on dates, RSVPs, a list of what we need, a calendar and a message board.</p>
  <p><a href="<%= @url %>" style="display:inline-block; background:#8e2a6b; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:bold">Choose your name and password</a></p>
  <p style="font-size:14px; color:#756370">Or paste this into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all"><%= @url %></span></p>
  <p style="font-size:14px">The link works once and expires in 7 days. If it stops working, ask <%= @inviter&.label || "the organizer" %> for a new one.</p>
  <p style="font-size:14px; color:#756370">The site is invite-only and hidden from search engines. The family sees only the display name you choose; your email is shown only to the organizers. If you were not expecting this, ignore this message and nothing will happen.</p>
</div>
